---
import { ArrowUpRight, Bot } from '@lucide/astro';
import { getCollection } from 'astro:content';
import AgentPreview from '../components/AgentPreview';
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { statusLabel } from '../lib/content';

const projects = await getCollection('projects');
const featured = projects.find(({ data }) => data.featured);
const organizing = projects.filter(({ data }) => data.status === 'organizing');
---

<BaseLayout title="Wu Yu · 从全栈工程，走向 AI Agent" description="吴禹的个人作品集：从全栈工程实践，走向 AI Agent 开发。">
	<section class="hero page-shell">
		<div class="hero__grid">
			<div><p class="eyebrow">2026 届 · 深圳 · FULL-STACK DEVELOPER</p><h1 class="display-heading hero__title">从全栈工程，<br /><em>走向 AI Agent。</em></h1></div>
			<div class="hero__copy"><p>我是吴禹，一名正在把 React、FastAPI、Docker 的工程实践延伸到 AI 应用开发的计算机专业毕业生。</p><div class="hero__actions"><a class="button-primary" href="/projects/spmtrack/">查看 SPMTrack <ArrowUpRight size={16} aria-hidden="true" /></a><a class="button-quiet" href="#agent">和我的 Agent 聊聊 <Bot size={16} aria-hidden="true" /></a></div><div class="hero__meta"><span>React / TypeScript</span><span>FastAPI / Docker</span><span>RAG V1.1 / Preview</span></div></div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="section page-shell" id="agent"><div class="section__header"><div><p class="eyebrow">01 / ASK MY KNOWLEDGE BASE</p><h2 class="section-heading">从一个问题开始。</h2></div><div class="section__header-copy"><p>推荐问题会带你快速了解项目、技术选择、学习方向和校园经历。线上 Preview 会检索资料片段并标注来源。</p></div></div><AgentPreview client:visible /></section>

	<section class="section page-shell"><div class="section__header"><div><p class="eyebrow">02 / SELECTED WORK</p><h2 class="section-heading">把研究代码，交付成产品。</h2></div><a class="text-link" href="/projects/">查看全部项目 <ArrowUpRight size={15} aria-hidden="true" /></a></div>
		{featured && <article class="featured-project surface"><div class="featured-project__visual"><div class="project-mark"><span>SPMTRACK / 2025—26</span><span>GRADUATION PROJECT</span></div><div class="project-diagram"><div class="project-diagram__node">React<br />workbench</div><div class="project-diagram__arrow">→</div><div class="project-diagram__node">Spring Boot<br />gateway</div><div class="project-diagram__arrow">→</div><div class="project-diagram__node">FastAPI<br />inference</div><div class="project-diagram__arrow">→</div><div class="project-diagram__node">PyTorch /<br />OpenCV</div></div><div class="project-mark"><span>VIDEO TRACKING WORKSPACE</span><span>01</span></div></div><div class="featured-project__body"><span class="status-label">{statusLabel(featured.data.status)} · {featured.data.category}</span><h3>{featured.data.title}</h3><p>{featured.data.summary}</p><div class="tag-row">{featured.data.tags.slice(0, 5).map((tag) => <span class="tag">{tag}</span>)}</div><a class="text-link" href="/projects/spmtrack/">阅读项目案例 <ArrowUpRight size={15} aria-hidden="true" /></a></div></article>}
		<div class="project-grid">{organizing.map((project, index) => <article class="project-card surface"><div class="project-card__top"><span>0{index + 2} / {project.data.date}</span><span class="status-label">{statusLabel(project.data.status)}</span></div><h3>{project.data.title}</h3><p>{project.data.summary}</p></article>)}</div>
	</section>

	<section class="section page-shell"><div class="section__header"><div><p class="eyebrow">03 / THE DIRECTION</p><h2 class="section-heading">正在形成的技术路径。</h2></div><div class="section__header-copy"><p>已有的工程经验，是我进入 AI Agent 开发的起点。现在先让检索、来源和失败边界可验证，再评估更复杂的语义检索。</p></div></div><div class="path"><div class="path__item"><span class="path__number">01</span><h3>前端交互</h3><p>React、TypeScript、Canvas，把复杂流程变成清晰的浏览器操作。</p></div><div class="path__item"><span class="path__number">02</span><h3>服务编排</h3><p>FastAPI、Spring Boot、任务状态机，管理长任务和稳定接口边界。</p></div><div class="path__item"><span class="path__number">03</span><h3>可复现交付</h3><p>Docker、健康检查和 smoke test，让项目可以被运行、验证和交接。</p></div><div class="path__item"><span class="path__number">04</span><h3>AI Agent</h3><p>已用 Markdown 分块和轻量检索构建 RAG V1.1，下一步再评估 Embedding 与 ChromaDB。</p></div></div></section>

	<section class="section page-shell"><div class="agent-teaser surface"><div class="agent-teaser__copy"><p class="eyebrow">A SMALL INVITATION</p><h2>别只看简历，<br />问我一个问题。</h2><p>从项目细节到学习方向，线上 Preview 会用检索到的资料片段回答，并显示本次来源。</p></div><div class="agent-teaser__preview"><div class="agent-teaser__bar"><span>WU YU · AGENT</span><span>RAG V1.1 / PREVIEW</span></div><div class="agent-teaser__question">“你为什么想做 AI Agent？”</div><a class="agent-teaser__prompt" href="#agent">点击开始对话 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
